OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after woman       
OL,4,Afatally hit by car                     
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by dangerous driving     
OL,8,Fafter a pedestrian was fatally struck  
OL,9,Fby a car.                              
OL,11,FThe collision happened shortly before  
OL,12,F14:50 GMT in Wherstead Road, Ipswich,  
OL,13,Fand involved a grey Nissan.            
OL,15,FAn air ambulance attended but Suffolk  
OL,16,FPolice said the pedestrian, a woman in 
OL,17,Fher 50s, died at the scene.            
OL,19,FThe Nissan driver, 26, was arrested and
OL,20,Ftaken to Martlesham Police             
OL,21,FInvestigation Centre for questioning,  
OL,22,Fwhere he remained on Wednesday evening.
